msgstr "此觀察結果回報了本機或遠端快取命中。"

#: lib/tuist_web/helpers/module_cache.ex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The module's own reported inputs stayed the same, but a dependency or external package hash changed."
msgstr "模組自身回報的輸入保持不變，但相依性或外部套件雜湊值已變更。"

#: lib/tuist_web/helpers/module_cache.ex:70
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Changed: module inputs changed. Upstream: dependencies changed. Cold: insufficient evidence. Evicted: a previously served key now misses."
msgstr "變更：模組輸入已變更。上游：相依性已變更。冷啟動：證據不足。淘汰：先前提供服務的金鑰現在未命中。"

